108	/**
109	 * Serve the SPA from static/ with a deep-link fallback: an unknown, non-API path returns
110	 * index.html so a browser refresh on a client route works. OfficeFloor REST routes and Spring
111	 * endpoints are matched first; only unmatched, non-{@code api/} paths fall through to the SPA.
112	 * TODO: confirm the API path prefix used by the OfficeFloor routes ("api/" assumed here).
